<body>

<table width=100%><tr><td bgcolor=#2E3A20 class=c style="padding:24px">
<p style="margin:0"><span style="color:#D9B85C;font-size:11pt;font-weight:bold">🌾&nbsp;&nbsp;CRITIC &amp; REVIEW BOARD — IMPROVEMENT PLAN</span></p>
<p style="margin:3px 0 0"><span style="color:#FBF7EC;font-size:27pt;font-weight:bold">Getting Near Stardew Valley</span></p>
<p style="margin:2px 0 0"><span style="color:#EAD9A8;font-size:13pt">Hearthbound Hollow &nbsp;·&nbsp; الاقتراب من ستارديو فالي</span></p>
<p style="margin:9px 0 0"><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:10.5pt;font-style:italic">From a 75-minute vignette (0/7 on Stardew's retention engines) to a compounding cozy home (7/7).</span></p>
</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:5px 0"></p>

<table width=100%><tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6 style="padding:11px 14px;border-left:5px solid #5C6E3F">
<span class="sg b" style="font-size:9pt">THE VERDICT IN ONE SENTENCE&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Hearthbound Hollow has the best <span class=b>hook, writing, art and tech</span> in cozy — but as a ~75-minute linear corridor it scored <span class="ru b">0/7</span> against Stardew's retention engines. The fix is not more writing; it is building the <span class=b>compounding daily loop</span> so players want to wake up tomorrow. The heart is a 9/10; the loop is <span class=b>buildable on everything that already exists</span> (Engagement-Bible Phases 61–67 have now built the seven pillars).
</td></tr></table>

<div class=h>🇬🇧 ENGLISH</div>

<p style="margin:8px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">1 · The Stardew benchmark — the 7 retention engines</span></p>
<table width=100% border=1 style="border:1px solid #CFE0B8">
<tr><th style="width:42%">Stardew's retention engine</th><th style="width:38%">Hearthbound (original 75-min slice)</th><th style="width:20%">Now</th></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>1 · <span class=b>Compounding daily loop</span> — today pays off tomorrow</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>Loop runs twice, then credits</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P1 built</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>2 · <span class=b>Player-authored goals</span> — you decide the day</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>The game decides; player follows a corridor</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P2/P6</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>3 · <span class=b>Ownership &amp; customization</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>The Hollow is fixed set-dressing</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P3</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>4 · <span class=b>Many interleaving systems</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>Two mini-games only</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P4/P5</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>5 · <span class=b>Tangible, visible progression</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>All progress hidden ("Cordray Principle")</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P6 · D-076</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>6 · <span class=b>A calendar of anticipation</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>No calendar event in the build</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P7</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>7 · <span class=b>Surprise &amp; variety</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>Fully deterministic, identical every run</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P2/P7</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:2px 0;font-size:8.6pt;font-style:italic;color:#6B6357">Original score: <span class="ru b">0 / 7</span>. The mismatch between the Steam promise ("a memory-brokerage shop simulator") and a linear demo is itself a refund driver.</p>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">2 · The fix — the 7 Engagement Pillars (0/7 → 7/7)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:9.4pt">The fantasy upgrades from <span class=b>"read a memory"</span> to <span class="sg b">"run the Hollow"</span> — a daily, gentle, compounding practice. Each pillar = one missing Stardew engine. Every pillar is <span class=b>opt-in &amp; unpunishing</span> (adds <i>pull</i>, never <i>push</i>).</p>
<table width=100% border=1 style="border:1px solid #CFE0B8">
<tr><th style="width:34%">Pillar</th><th style="width:46%">Player feeling</th><th style="width:20%">Status</th></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P1 · The Living Day</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>"A new day. What shall I do with it?"</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ Phase 61</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P2 · The Request Board</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>"Who needs me today? A new face!"</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ Phase 62</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P3 · My Hollow</span> (stock/upgrade/decorate)</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>"This is mine, and it's getting better."</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ Phase 64</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P4 · The Garden &amp; Tea</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>"My lavender's ready — time to brew."</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ Phase 65</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P5 · The Living Workbench</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>"I'm getting good at this. One more."</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ Phase 66</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P6 · The Memory Wall</span> (Echo Web)</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>"Two more and I complete Doris's thread!"</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ Phase 63</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P7 · The Almanac</span> (festivals)</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>"The Honey Festival is in 3 days!"</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ Phase 67</td></tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">3 · The new core loop</span></p>
<table width=100%><tr><td bgcolor=#2E3A20 style="padding:10px 12px">
<pre class=mono>  &#9788; A NEW MORNING  &mdash; the Agenda card slides in (2&ndash;3 visitors, garden status, a gentle goal)
        &#9474;  player chooses the order &mdash; NO forced path
   &#9484;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9516;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9516;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9516;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9488;
   OPEN SHOP   TEND GARDEN   WALK VILLAGE   DO THE CRAFT
   take a      grow &rarr; brew  deliver,      Polish/Cleanse/
   memory      teas (tools)  chat, echoes   Weave/Sort/Listen
   &#9492;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9524;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9516;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9524;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9472;&#9496;
              &#128176; SPEND / GROW  &larr; the compounding bit
        (shelf, herb bed, decor, tool; arrange the Wall)
              &#127769; CLOSE THE LEDGER &mdash; celebratory recap + tomorrow tease &#8635;</pre>
</td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:3px 0;font-size:9pt"><span class=b>Why it retains:</span> it compounds (coin&rarr;shelves/beds/tools&rarr;more coin), it's player-directed, it varies (board reshuffles, Almanac festivals, garden cycles), it pays off tomorrow, and it <span class=b>still tells the story</span> — Doris, Gerrold, Marin &amp; the Echo Web are now spread across the loop.</p>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">4 · The new success gate &amp; the guardrails</span></p>
<table width=100%><tr>
<td bgcolor=#F0F4E6 style="padding:9px 12px;width:50%;border-left:4px solid #5C6E3F">
<p style="margin:0 0 2px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:9pt">GATE G-ENGAGE (the only honest metric)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9pt">20 cozy testers play <span class=b>3 in-game days</span>. <span class=b>≥15/20</span> voluntarily start a <span class=b>4th day</span> unprompted, and <span class=b>≥60%</span> name a self-set goal. Choose Day 4 &rarr; we have a game.</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor=#FBF3E2 style="padding:9px 12px;width:50%;border-left:4px solid #9C6B1E">
<p style="margin:0 0 2px"><span class="am b" style="font-size:9pt">GUARDRAILS EVERY PILLAR INHERITS</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:8.8pt">• Cozy Contract holds — no fail states; no "FAILED" ever<br>• No dark monetization, ever (trust is the moat)<br>• Feedback is celebratory, never anxious (D-076)<br>• Writing bar unchanged; AI dialogue forbidden<br>• Respect the asmdef graph; idempotent under 🚀 Build Everything</p>
</td></tr></table>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">5 · Recommended next steps (in order)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">1.</span> <span class=b>Run G-Engage (Phase 70)</span> — the 3-day looped playtest; instrument voluntary Day 4. The single most important action.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">2.</span> <span class=b>Tune pacing (Phase 71)</span> — space heavy grief beats across the loop (Comedy/Grief radius).</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">3.</span> <span class=b>Marketing-truth pass (Phase 72)</span> — align README/Steam copy with the now-real loop.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">4.</span> <span class=b>Deepen content (Phase 68+)</span> — 4–6 more Vignette-Library villagers + Echo threads toward the 40-hour promise.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">5.</span> <span class=b>Skill ceilings (P5)</span> — finish gentle mastery curves so the 20th craft still satisfies.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">6.</span> <span class=b>Protect the prize</span> — never let the loop dilute the writing. Build the reason to keep unwrapping it.</p>

<br clear=all style="page-break-before:always">

<div class=h hr dir=rtl style="border-left:none;border-right:7px solid #5C6E3F;padding:2px 10px 2px 0;text-align:right">🇸🇦 العربية</div>

<div dir=rtl style="text-align:right">

<p style="margin:8px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">١ · المعيار مقابل ستارديو — محرّكات الاستبقاء السبعة</span></p>
<table width=100% border=1 dir=rtl style="border:1px solid #CFE0B8">
<tr><th style="width:42%;text-align:right">محرّك الاستبقاء في ستارديو</th><th style="width:38%;text-align:right">الجوف الدافئ (الشريحة الأصلية ٧٥ دقيقة)</th><th style="width:20%;text-align:right">الآن</th></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>١ · <span class=b>حلقة يومية متراكمة</span> — اليوم يُثمر غدًا</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>تعمل الحلقة مرّتين ثم تنتهي</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P1</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>٢ · <span class=b>أهداف يضعها اللاعب</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>اللعبة تقرّر؛ واللاعب يتبع ممرًّا</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P2/P6</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>٣ · <span class=b>التملّك والتخصيص</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>الجوف ديكور ثابت لا يتغيّر</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P3</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>٤ · <span class=b>أنظمة متشابكة كثيرة</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>لعبتان مصغّرتان فقط</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P4/P5</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>٥ · <span class=b>تقدّم ملموس ومرئي</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>كلّ التقدّم مخفيّ (مبدأ كوردراي)</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P6 · D-076</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>٦ · <span class=b>تقويم يبعث على الترقّب</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>لا حدث تقويميّ في النسخة</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ P7</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>٧ · <span class=b>المفاجأة والتنوّع</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>حتميّة تمامًا ومتطابقة كلّ مرّة</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ P2/P7</td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:2px 0;font-size:8.6pt;font-style:italic;color:#6B6357">النتيجة الأصلية: <span class="ru b">٠ / ٧</span>. والتناقض بين وعد ستيم وبين عرضٍ خطّيّ هو بحدّ ذاته سببٌ لطلبات الاسترداد.</p>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">٢ · الحلّ — ركائز التفاعل السبع (من ٠/٧ إلى ٧/٧)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:9.4pt">يرتقي الخيال من <span class=b>«قراءة ذكرى»</span> إلى <span class="sg b">«إدارة الجوف»</span> — ممارسة يوميّة دافئة متراكمة. كلّ ركيزة = محرّك ستارديو ناقص. وكلّ ركيزة <span class=b>اختياريّة وغير معاقِبة</span> (تضيف <i>جذبًا</i> لا <i>دفعًا</i>).</p>
<table width=100% border=1 dir=rtl style="border:1px solid #CFE0B8">
<tr><th style="width:34%;text-align:right">الركيزة</th><th style="width:46%;text-align:right">شعور اللاعب</th><th style="width:20%;text-align:right">الحالة</th></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P1 · اليوم الحيّ</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>«يومٌ جديد. بماذا أقضيه؟»</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ م٦١</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P2 · لوحة الطلبات</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>«من يحتاجني اليوم؟ وجهٌ جديد!»</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ م٦٢</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P3 · جَوفي</span> (تجهيز/تطوير/تزيين)</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>«هذا مِلكي، وهو يتحسّن.»</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ م٦٤</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P4 · الحديقة والشاي</span></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>«اللافندر جاهز — وقت التحضير.»</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ م٦٥</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P5 · طاولة العمل الحيّة</span></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>«صرتُ بارعًا. مرّة أخرى.»</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ م٦٦</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><span class=b>P6 · جدار الذكريات</span> (شبكة الأصداء)</td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6><i>«اثنتان وأُكمل خيط دوريس!»</i></td><td bgcolor=#F0F4E6>✅ م٦٣</td></tr>
<tr><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><span class=b>P7 · التقويم</span> (المهرجانات)</td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC><i>«مهرجان العسل بعد ٣ أيام!»</i></td><td bgcolor=#FBF7EC>✅ م٦٧</td></tr>
</table>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">٣ · البوابة الجديدة للنجاح والضوابط</span></p>
<table width=100% dir=rtl><tr>
<td bgcolor=#F0F4E6 style="padding:9px 12px;width:50%;border-right:4px solid #5C6E3F">
<p style="margin:0 0 2px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:9pt">البوابة G-Engage (المقياس الصادق الوحيد)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9pt">يلعب ٢٠ مختبِرًا <span class=b>٣ أيام</span>. يبدأ <span class=b>١٥/٢٠</span> منهم <span class=b>يومًا رابعًا</span> طوعًا، ويُسمّي <span class=b>≥٦٠٪</span> هدفًا وضعوه بأنفسهم. اختيار اليوم الرابع ← لدينا لعبة.</p>
</td>
<td bgcolor=#FBF3E2 style="padding:9px 12px;width:50%;border-right:4px solid #9C6B1E">
<p style="margin:0 0 2px"><span class="am b" style="font-size:9pt">ضوابط ترثها كلّ ركيزة</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:8.8pt">• ميثاق الدفء قائم — لا حالات فشل؛ ولا كلمة «فشل» أبدًا<br>• لا تربّح مظلم أبدًا (الثقة هي الحصن)<br>• التغذية الراجعة احتفائية لا مُقلِقة (D-076)<br>• سقف الكتابة ثابت؛ حوار الذكاء الاصطناعي ممنوع<br>• احترام رسم asmdef؛ كلّ شيء قابل لإعادة التشغيل خلف 🚀 Build Everything</p>
</td></tr></table>

<p style="margin:9px 0 3px"><span class="sg b" style="font-size:11.5pt">٤ · الخطوات التالية الموصى بها (بالترتيب)</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">١.</span> <span class=b>نفّذ G-Engage (المرحلة ٧٠)</span> — اختبار الأيام الثلاثة؛ وقِس اليوم الرابع الطوعي. أهمّ إجراء منفرد.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">٢.</span> <span class=b>اضبط الإيقاع (المرحلة ٧١)</span> — وزّع بِيتات الحزن الثقيلة عبر الحلقة.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">٣.</span> <span class=b>جولة «صدق التسويق» (المرحلة ٧٢)</span> — مواءمة نصوص README/ستيم مع الحلقة الحقيقية.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">٤.</span> <span class=b>عمّق المحتوى (المرحلة ٦٨+)</span> — ٤–٦ قرويين وخيوط أصداء إضافية نحو وعد الـ٤٠ ساعة.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">٥.</span> <span class=b>أسقف المهارة (P5)</span> — أكمِل منحنيات الإتقان كي تبقى الحِرفة العشرون مُرضية.</p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:9.4pt"><span class="sg b">٦.</span> <span class=b>احمِ الجائزة</span> — لا تدع الحلقة تُميّع الكتابة. ابنِ سبب الاستمرار في كشفها.</p>

</div>

<p style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;color:#6B6357">Critic &amp; Review Board synthesis · distilled from Docs/Engagement_Bible · feat/mission-1-2-architecture · 2026 · Abdulmalek Agents</p>

</body></html>
